      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Xavier%2C_Montana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "St. Xavier lies on the Crow Indian Reservation along the Bighorn River in southeastern Montana.",
